# SHAPE (ENV): each voice's sound, four knobs and its level (ALGO), kept with the journey. PULSE's level
# down (the kick sits under the drone) and its decay longer; ENV again: the next voice, TEXTURE's colour
# darker. Held, a button says what it does and does nothing else; an idle page goes home after 30 s.
autoplay 0
wait 300
tap ENV
expect view 1
turn SELECT 4
turn ALGO -10
expect shape30 60
expect set_bpm 90
turn K2 5
expect shape32 90
tap ENV
turn K1 -5
expect shape41 54
shot shape.png
tap SAVE
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 300
expect shape30 60
expect shape41 54
listen
press SEQ
wait 900
release SEQ
wait 100
said START, STOP
expect playing 0
tap FX
expect view 3
turn K1 3
shot fx.png
wait 31000
expect view 0
